WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.160
If your prep is PEG, this video will walk you through exactly how to take it.

2
00:00:04.160 --> 00:00:06.000
Just follow along step by step.

3
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:09.520
Your prep is the large container that you'll mix with water.

4
00:00:09.520 --> 00:00:13.760
You'll also want crystal light or flavor packs on hand if you'd like to improve

5
00:00:13.760 --> 00:00:14.160
the taste.

6
00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:18.640
At 8 a.m. the day before your procedure, you'll mix the prep.

7
00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:22.960
Add water to your prep container and stir or shake until everything is fully

8
00:00:22.960 --> 00:00:23.600
dissolved.

9
00:00:23.600 --> 00:00:27.960
Once it's mixed, put it in the refrigerator. Keeping it cold makes it much

10
00:00:27.960 --> 00:00:29.040
easier to drink.

11
00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:33.360
If you're adding crystal light or a flavor pack, you can mix that in now.

12
00:00:33.360 --> 00:00:36.880
Just make sure it's not red, orange, blue, or purple.

13
00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.960
Stick to clear or light colored flavors.

14
00:00:38.960 --> 00:00:43.120
Between 4 and 5 p.m. you'll begin drinking the solution.

15
00:00:43.120 --> 00:00:48.240
Here's the pace. Drink 16 ounces. That's about two cups every 30 minutes.

16
00:00:48.240 --> 00:00:52.500
You'll keep going at that pace for about four hours until the entire container

17
00:00:52.500 --> 00:00:52.960
is empty.

18
00:00:52.960 --> 00:00:57.920
Take your time with each glass. Slow steady sips are easier on your stomach

19
00:00:57.920 --> 00:00:58.400
than trying

20
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:03.360
to gulp at all at once. This part is really important. You must drink all of

21
00:01:03.360 --> 00:01:03.680
the prep

22
00:01:03.680 --> 00:01:07.280
solution as directed, even if you're already passing clear liquid.

23
00:01:07.280 --> 00:01:12.720
I know it can feel like enough, but finishing the entire dose is what gives us

24
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.360
the clearest

25
00:01:13.360 --> 00:01:17.920
view during your procedure. If the prep isn't completed as directed, we may

26
00:01:17.920 --> 00:01:18.960
need to reschedule,

27
00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.270
and neither of us wants that. Once you've finished, keep drinking clear liquids

28
00:01:23.270 --> 00:01:24.000
until bedtime.

29
00:01:24.000 --> 00:01:28.000
Staying hydrated will help you feel better and help the prep do its job.

30
00:01:28.800 --> 00:01:32.800
If you experience any discomfort from frequent trips to the bathroom,

31
00:01:32.800 --> 00:01:37.680
applying a petroleum-based ointment or diaper rash cream can really help.

32
00:01:37.680 --> 00:01:43.310
That's it. You've got this. Follow the timing, finish the full dose, and stay

33
00:01:43.310 --> 00:01:44.320
hydrated.

34
00:01:44.320 --> 00:01:48.870
If you have any questions at all, don't hesitate to call our office. We're here

35
00:01:48.870 --> 00:01:49.520
to help.
